# Mintlify ships a list of built-in ignores -- see "Default ignored patterns" at
# https://www.mintlify.com/docs/organize/mintignore. Don't restate that list here;
# it drifts. What matters is where it stops: it covers .agents/ and .claude/, but
# among repo-root Markdown only README, LICENSE, CHANGELOG and CONTRIBUTING. Any
# other root .md is published -- docs.extole.com/AGENTS.md served our internal
# agent guide until the entries below were added.
#
# .mintlify/ is never served, so the writing standards there need no entry.

# Agent config the built-ins miss (CLAUDE.md needs no entry: it lives in .claude/)
.cursor/
AGENTS.md

# Draft content
drafts/
*.draft.mdx
